at=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hvCF4-28yPUQ7kNvwFDFBXE&_nc_oc=AdpR3GRQO1J6y5xZ4ZyAbgSqDaSKtjbl2E_dgchSf4xj2xxh-hYpWbr6ZzdlEUWbArk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQToJXak9qsDsQYAaSLqU3E0DV8kMx0S9HoXTT61u2y6cA&oe=6AF9E27C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses is an immersive VR training application designed exclusively for learners enrolled in the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses Micro-Credential Program.\n\nThis hands-on simulation enables learners to develop practical skills in identifying electrical fuse failures, diagnosing circuit-related issues, following proper safety procedures, and performing fuse replacement in a realistic virtual environment. The training experience is built to replicate real-world troubleshooting scenarios, allowing users to practice critical technical procedures in a safe and controlled setting.\n\nThis application is not intended for general public use. Access is restricted only to individuals officially enrolled in the Immerse Learn micro-credential program as part of their interactive skills training and assessment experience.", "short_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses is a VR training application developed as part of the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses Micro-Credential Program. This immersive simulation provides hands-on practice in identifying fuse-related issues, diagnosing faults, and safely replacing fuses in real-world scenarios. Access to this application is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the micro-credential program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating":